I am back home in the flat.
I unpack my groceries.
I wash the potatoes.
Then I prop the mobile phone up on the kitchen counter.
I press play.
The chef looks directly into the camera in the video.
He speaks very loudly and full of energy.
"First, boil the potatoes!" he calls out.
I smile at his dramatic voice.
I take a large pot.
I fill the pot with water.
Then I add some salt.
I put the pot on the stove.
I put the potatoes into the water.
Now I turn on the stove.
The water is slowly getting warm.
Step one is quite simple.
I am already looking forward to the next step.
